$ apprafter target list
[exit 1]
[stdout]
[stderr]
<ESC>[2m<TS><ESC>[0m <ESC>[32m INFO<ESC>[0m target list invoked
Error: apprafter::target::invalid_config

  × target config at <SANDBOX>/apprafter-config/config.yaml:
  │ active_target: invalid type: sequence, expected a string at line 1 column
  │ 16
  help: <SANDBOX>/apprafter-config/config.yaml could not be read as the
        target store's configuration: it was edited by hand or written by an
        incompatible CLI version. Fix it by hand (it is a small YAML file), or
        restore it from a backup. It records only which target is the default,
        so deleting it and choosing the default again with `apprafter target
        use <name>` works too.

